046762960 success). Worktree advanced to the merged commit, which contains the 895c Bedrock fix d8adf0f5654 — so the close ran with the REBAR_LLM_*_MODEL overrides UNSET and the completion-verifier gate passed on its own, no --force. Ticket 34b5-ad7d-b983-47f9 (enunciable-paganist-chevrotain) status=closed, all 8 ACs checked. Residual-gap sweep: parity census had no applicable surfaces (GH Actions schedule, no rebar verb); no test exclusions; no tier escalations; plan-review's 3 findings were all auto-deferred below their block thresholds. One accepted item: tests/unit/grounding/test_coverage_reconstruction.py::test_full_backend_account_is_present fails on THIS HOST for the 'metric' backend — proven pre-existing (identical failure at base 676c85e604) and green on all CI runners, so out of scope for this ticket.","timestamp":1785965184687317001}],"created_at":1785962263478592001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"18ec4007-8fae-43cf-87e7-074eef041a96","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"34b5-ad7d-b983-47f9"}],"description":"","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","34b5-ad7d-b983-47f9"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0c55-4493-b95a-47a4","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement 34b5: move CodeQL to the 6-hourly branch-health tick","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b97325d1-967f-4e3c-b9c9-e4cb4f8f773f","18ec4007-8fae-43cf-87e7-074eef041a96","d6d13346-79c1-4153-b63d-14f8dba5f562","4867906a-25f2-4c36-b715-6cb28680add3","7c5ac823-ac1a-4892-807d-33bf69eec1d0","cf7937fc-288a-4dcb-aa12-c1788125ac0d","94aaf274-4630-43df-8a3c-65bc81ea6201"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659524918329001,"uuid":"e3661dc0-d136-4